    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want to \"navigate\" it. i just want it to stop. i want the noise to stop. it feels like i'm just a mistake that needs to be corrected, like i'm a bug in a system that should have never been there in the first place. if i'm just causing more damage by existing, isn't the most honest thing to just... let go of the burden? to stop being a problem?",
